{'symbol': 'NLSN', 'date': '2021-07-27 09:30:00', 'title': 'NIELSEN UNVEILS COOKIELESS APPROACH FOR AUDIENCE AND OUTCOMES MEASUREMENT IN THE U.S.', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JULY 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY, NIELSEN (NYSE: NLSN) ANNOUNCED ITS APPROACH TO ELIMINATE ITS RELIANCE ON DIGITAL IDENTIFIERS AND ENSURE THAT ADVERTISERS AND PUBLISHERS CAN CONTINUE TO MEASURE CONFIDENTLY IN A DYNAMIC, PRIVACY-FIRST MEDIA ENVIRONMENT.\xa0 WITH ITS NEW APPROACH TO MEASURING AUTHENTICATED AND UNAUTHENTICATED WEB TRAFFIC, NIELSEN WILL BECOME THE LEADING PLATFORM TO VALIDATE FIRST PARTY SERVER DATA WITH REAL CONSUMER BEHAVIOR.'}